<title>CHINA: Solectron starts building in Suzhou, China.</title>
<headline>Solectron starts building in Suzhou, China.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. electronics manufacturer Corp has begun construction of a $45 million factory in Suzhou to the west of Shanghai and expects production to begin in about one year, a company official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The official, contacted by telephone in Suzhou, said the factory was wholly-owned by Solectron and would produce printed circuit boards with an annual output value of about $15 million.</p>
</text>
